TaraSec network role note

- WAN_IF: physical/ordinary Internet uplink.
- LAN_IF: client-side LAN/hotspot interface.
- NetBird wt* interfaces: management plane only; do not use as WAN_IF or LAN_IF.

Use misc/net_setup.conf with misc/net_setup.pl. Review the generated /root/taransvar/iptables.sh before applying it.
